# State estimation

This branch estimates the voltages of a network from redundant, weighted measurements by Gauss-Newton, and returns the residuals and covariance that expose bad data.

## Choosing A Surface

Use `estimate` when the measured quantities are redundant and noisy. Read the objective and the normalised residuals after every estimate.

## Practical Examples

The examples exercise the principal surface of this branch.

